        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the logic. Test your luck. Beat the clock.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Tob One</strong>, your mind is your greatest tool. Forget traditional journeys: here, every stage is a high-pressure puzzle that tests your quick thinking and logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Scanner:</strong> At the start of every level, you must scan mystery cards. The system generates an immediate report of the values found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sum:</strong> Using logic inspired by classics like Minesweeper, you must combine the card values to reach the exact target number required for that level (e.g., hitting exactly 9 in the first level).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Timer:</strong> Time waits for no one. You must perform your calculations and make split-second decisions before the timer runs out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Progression:</strong> Difficulty ramps up gradually, demanding more complex math and risk-taking as you advance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy Meets Luck:</strong> Analyze the reports, choose your cards carefully, and hope that fortune is on your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Test of Intelligence:</strong> Every mistake can be fatal, but every victory pushes you to higher levels of intensity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you keep your cool under pressure and hit the perfect sum before time expires? Your next challenge awaits.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955620/extras/51633a956c298c880e4055a1c88132c7.avif?t=1784135521\" data-big-src=https: